{"id":"vod_bf_5179","vodId":"5179","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"出包王女第一季","name_cn":"出包王女第一季","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-6/1014f40940a32545e99cce0a9a492b10.jpg"},"summary":"结城梨斗（渡边明乃 配音）正派开朗，细心友善。一直以来，梨斗都暗恋着青梅竹马西连寺春菜（矢作纱友里 配音），可是，对于恋爱一窍不通的梨斗只是将这份强烈的感情深深的埋藏在心底。终于，梨斗再也无法压抑心中对于春菜的爱意了，再三地鼓起勇气，他决定向春菜表白。　　一次偶然中，一位名叫菈菈（户松遥 配音）的女孩从天而降出现在了梨斗的面前，在阴差阳错之间，菈菈竟然成为了梨斗的告白对象，就这样，梨斗和自称是外星公主的菈菈开始了同居生活。也就是从这时开始，杀手暗影（福圆美里 配音）、菈菈的妹妹娜娜（伊藤加奈惠 配音）和梦梦（丰崎爱生 配音）等人接二连三的来到了梨斗的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 17:32:49","classic":true,"classicRank":0,"franchise":"出包王女","playable":true,"episodeCount":32,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"OVA01","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvdiyiji/OVA01/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OVA02","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvdiyiji/OVA02/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OVA03","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvdiyiji/OVA03/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OVA04","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvdiyiji/OVA04/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OVA05","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvdiyiji/OVA05/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OVA06","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvdiyiji/OVA06/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvdiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvdiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvdiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvdiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvdiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvdiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvdiyiji/第0